# Google Large Photos Remover

Node.js 20+ ESM CLI. Automates Google One web UI via Playwright — not official Google APIs.

## Invariants

- Prefer Node built-ins and already-installed `playwright`. Check `npm view <name> version` before adding a package; run `npm audit` after installs.
- Never commit `.auth/`, `.env`, cookies, tokens, or credential files. Session lives in `.auth/` via `launchPersistentContext`.
- Destructive actions (delete) require explicit user confirmation; do not soften or skip prompts.
- Match existing style in `src/`: ESM imports, JSDoc on exports, early returns, 2-space indent, path comment at top of files.
- Official Photos/Drive APIs are out of scope. UI selectors may break when Google changes the page — prefer resilient role/text locators and reuse helpers in `src/`.
- After commits, stale artifacts cleanup runs via `.githooks/post-commit` (see `stale-artifacts` rule).
